        "text": "The dispute centered on whether HHS could set different Medicare reimbursement rates for 340B hospitals using \u201coption\u202f2\u201d (price\u2011based calculation) without first conducting a cost\u2011study of hospitals\u2019 acquisition costs as required by the statute."
