            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 17,
              "start": 17
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court concluded that, absent a survey of hospitals\u2019 acquisition costs, HHS may not vary the reimbursement rates for 340B hospitals; the 2018 and 2019 rates were contrary to the statute and unlawful."
      },
      {
