              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to American Hospital Association (Petitioner), the petitioners argued that the reimbursement rates for 340B hospitals differed from those for other hospitals and that HHS failed to conduct the statutory cost study."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "American Hospital Association (Petitioner)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "04c04c6f4ebb6c86b7acb501f483c54ef28468c8579ab9e7df9aa4d43f0b29a6",
              "evidence_ids": [
