              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 7,
                "start": 7
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to American Hospital Association (Petitioner), they contend that Congress did not intend to delegate to HHS the authority to vary reimbursement rates without a cost study."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "American Hospital Association (Petitioner)",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "04c04c6f4ebb6c86b7acb501f483c54ef28468c8579ab9e7df9aa4d43f0b29a6",
