              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-04c04c6f4ebb-0000-0006"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 11,
                "start": 11
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to American Hospital Association (Petitioner), they assert that Congress legislates not only objectives but also the means, requiring a cost\u2011study to ensure accuracy and transparency."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "American Hospital Association",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "4a073a7488831863f1a28a7a7cd2692ca70bc6ba192bef152e63bd0c9ee59675",
              "evidence_ids": [
